msgctxt "80"
msgid "Shit! We know you're back in town now! You're gonna pay for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Sorry about that. Didn't wanna get you involved in all this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "...It's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "So where'd you wanna go next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Hmm... how about Shangri-La? For old time's sake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Shangri-La?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Right. If we keep going straight along Taihei Boulevard, there should be a "
"high-class brothel over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Here we are. The Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Real colossus, huh. Must have taken a lot to get it built."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I heard a lot of rumors about this place. They say some bad stuff went down "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"And just now, I heard some people talkin' about a chopper shootin' the hell "
"out of it once?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Oh, yeah... There've also been two bombing incidents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Bombing incidents!? What's this city coming to...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hey! You got a lotta nerve comin' back to this city, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "And you ain't gettin' a free pass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Get this asshole! This time, he's leaving town in a fuckin' hearse!"
msgstr ""

